      "diff": "@@ -1187,10 +1187,10 @@ A https://appvisor.com/pad/[PAD] file is also published at https://www.wireshark\n [discrete]\n ===== Artwork\n \n-Logo and icon artwork can be found in the _image_ directory in the\n+Logo and icon artwork can be found in the _resources_ directory in the\n distribution. This is available online at\n \n-{wireshark-code-browse-url}/image\n+{wireshark-code-browse-url}/resources\n \n [discrete]\n ===== Licensing\n@@ -1201,8 +1201,8 @@ later. Make sure you and your package comply with this license.\n [discrete]\n ===== Trademarks\n \n-Wireshark and the “fin” logo are registered trademarks of the Wireshark\n-Foundation. Make sure you and your package comply with trademark law.\n+Wireshark, Stratoshark, and their respective “fin” logos are trademarks of the link:{wireshark-foundation-url}[Wireshark Foundation].\n+If you have any questions about the use of these trademarks, please contact the foundation.\n \n [discrete]\n ===== Privileges\n",
